### End the session — DELETE /api/v1/session
# Clears it, whether or not one was open. What it answers and refuses: ../../contracts/in/web-session-api.md

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie sign-in.http sets.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here
# Set from the XSRF-TOKEN cookie current-session.http returns.
@csrfToken = paste-the-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value-here

### Sign out.
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/session
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{csrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
